// Package mathx binds a function of a system library: cbrt from the
// math library, m, which the module file names with link m. The C
// side is a shim of one line in mathx.c, since a bound function is
// always defined under its derived symbol.
package mathx

// Cbrt is the cube root of x, from the system's math library.
func Cbrt(x f64) f64
